message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "geo-herd-rider: an AI agent that reads a news firehose and automates a recurring judgment call"
abstract: >-
  A research project in automated decisioning. An LLM curator reads a continuous
  feed of unstructured financial news, names the tickers the press explicitly
  flags as thesis-driven movers while still framed as early, and rules each week
  on whether a driving catalyst is still live. The LLM never forecasts magnitude
  and never sizes a position; a deterministic mean-variance optimizer does that,
  so every number is auditable and reproducible from code. Dual-licensed:
  documentation under CC BY 4.0, software under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0.
type: software
